  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.0,
      "en": "Hello English Nerds, welcome back to EnglishPod.",
      "zh": "您好英语书呆子，欢迎回到 Englishpod。"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 6.0,
      "end": 6.51,
      "en": "My name is Marco.",
      "zh": "我叫 Marco。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 6.79,
      "end": 7.51,
      "en": "And I'm Erica.",
      "zh": "我叫 Erica。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 8.07,
      "end": 14.59,
      "en": "And today we're going to be looking at English slang and informal words used in the 1980s.",
      "zh": "今天我们将研究 1980 年代使用的英语俚语和非正式单词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 14.73,
      "end": 19.17,
      "en": "So this is the next part of our decades dialogues.",
      "zh": "所以这是我们几十年对话的下一部分。"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 19.27,
      "end": 19.77,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 20.0,
      "end": 32.44,
      "en": "So the 1980s maybe for many of our listeners is a little bit more familiar and there are a lot of phrases and a lot of words that were born in this decade and we still use them today.",
      "zh": "因此，对于我们的许多听众来说，1980 年代可能会更加熟悉，并且在这十年中诞生了很多短语和单词，我们今天仍然使用它们。"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 32.44,
      "end": 34.93,
      "en": "So we're going to learn those words and phrases in this dialogue.",
      "zh": "所以我们将在这次对话中学习这些单词和短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 35.4,
      "end": 38.39,
      "en": "But before we start, we need to preview a couple of words.",
      "zh": "但在我们开始之前，我们需要预览几个单词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 38.67,
      "end": 40.33,
      "en": "Let's go now to vocabulary preview.",
      "zh": "现在让我们进入词汇预览。"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 42.2,
      "end": 43.88,
      "en": "Vocabulary preview.",
      "zh": "词汇预习。"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 43.88,
      "end": 46.95,
      "en": "So one of the words that we're going to hear in our dialogue is ride.",
      "zh": "因此，我们将在对话中听到的单词之一是骑行。"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 47.88,
      "end": 48.79,
      "en": "Is that your ride?",
      "zh": "那是你的骑行吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 49.84,
      "end": 50.59,
      "en": "Is that your ride?",
      "zh": "那是你的骑行吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 50.84,
      "end": 51.65,
      "en": "So a ride.",
      "zh": "所以骑。"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 52.11,
      "end": 54.97,
      "en": "Normally, we know this word as a verb, right?",
      "zh": "通常，我们知道这个词是一个动词，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 55.59,
      "end": 56.73,
      "en": "To ride a bicycle.",
      "zh": "骑自行车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 57.44,
      "end": 61.96,
      "en": "In this context, it's an informal way of referring to your car.",
      "zh": "在这种情况下，这是一种非正式的方式来引用您的汽车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 61.96,
      "end": 63.55,
      "en": "So a ride is a car.",
      "zh": "所以乘车就是一辆车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 63.81,
      "end": 66.03,
      "en": "Yeah, so I just bought a new ride.",
      "zh": "是的，所以我刚买了一辆新车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 66.43,
      "end": 69.47,
      "en": "All right, well, maybe you'll take me for a ride in your new ride.",
      "zh": "好吧，也许你会带我去你的新骑行。"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 69.68,
      "end": 70.19,
      "en": "In your new ride.",
      "zh": "在你的新骑行中。"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 70.68,
      "end": 71.68,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 71.68,
      "end": 72.68,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 72.68,
      "end": 75.44,
      "en": "And we're also going to be looking at this word loaded.",
      "zh": "我们还将查看加载的这个词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 75.44,
      "end": 75.85,
      "en": "He's loaded.",
      "zh": "他装载了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 76.96,
      "end": 79.25,
      "en": "So if you are loaded.",
      "zh": "所以如果你被加载。"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 79.44,
      "end": 79.99,
      "en": "You're really rich.",
      "zh": "你真的很有钱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 80.44,
      "end": 81.53,
      "en": "You have a lot of money.",
      "zh": "你有很多钱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 81.6,
      "end": 83.84,
      "en": "You are loaded with money.",
      "zh": "你装满了钱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 83.84,
      "end": 85.64,
      "en": "So loaded and ride.",
      "zh": "所以加载和骑。"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 85.64,
      "end": 87.75,
      "en": "Those are two words for vocabulary preview.",
      "zh": "这是词汇预览的两个词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 88.28,
      "end": 92.51,
      "en": "And well, let's listen to our 1980s dialogue and see what happens.",
      "zh": "好吧，让我们听听我们 1980 年代的对话，看看会发生什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 101.22,
      "end": 102.68,
      "en": "Jim, what's up, man?",
      "zh": "吉姆，怎么了，伙计？"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 103.0,
      "end": 104.94,
      "en": "Charlie, is that your ride?",
      "zh": "查理，那是你的车吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 105.68,
      "end": 108.56,
      "en": "It's butt ugly, dude.",
      "zh": "伙计，这车丑死了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 108.56,
      "end": 109.34,
      "en": "Don't be an airhead.",
      "zh": "别犯傻。"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 109.96,
      "end": 112.08,
      "en": "This is a 1969 Chevy Impala.",
      "zh": "这是一辆 1969 年的雪佛兰黑斑羚。"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 112.8,
      "end": 114.02,
      "en": "I just need to fix it up a bit.",
      "zh": "我稍微整修一下就好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 114.44,
      "end": 116.34,
      "en": "In a couple of months, this baby is going to be wicked.",
      "zh": "过几个月，这宝贝肯定酷毙了。"
    },
