      "zh": "只要老爸跟他爸一样有钱，谁都能开上这种车。"
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "start": 127.16,
      "end": 127.7,
      "en": "He's coming this way.",
      "zh": "他来这边。"
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "start": 128.16,
      "end": 129.16,
      "en": "Be cool.",
      "zh": "冷静点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "start": 129.16,
      "end": 130.16,
      "en": "Hey, guys.",
      "zh": "嗨，各位。"
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 133.91,
      "end": 135.09,
      "en": "What do you think of my automobile?",
      "zh": "你觉得我的车怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 135.76,
      "end": 137.48,
