      "zh": "所以一个新鲜的旅程。"
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "start": 257.64,
      "end": 258.76,
      "en": "It's another way of saying cool.",
      "zh": "这是另一种说酷的方式。"
    },
    {
      "id": 106,
      "start": 259.24,
      "end": 259.54,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "start": 259.76,
      "end": 261.78,
      "en": "So kind of similar, wicked and fresh.",
      "zh": "如此相似，邪恶和新鲜。"
    },
    {
      "id": 108,
      "start": 262.26,
      "end": 267.34,
      "en": "Now finally, at the end of our dialogue, they said, you're a real scumbag, Charlie.",
      "zh": "最后，在我们的对话结束时，他们说，你是一个真正的渣男，查理。"
    },
    {
      "id": 109,
      "start": 267.7,
      "end": 269.6,
      "en": "So this word scumbag is interesting.",
      "zh": "所以这个词scumbag很有趣。"
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
      "start": 270.24,
      "end": 271.22,
      "en": "You're a scumbag.",
      "zh": "你是个渣男"
