      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "start": 533.48,
      "end": 535.28,
      "en": "Do the nasty is a little bit more rude.",
      "zh": "做讨厌更粗鲁一点。"
