      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 538.76,
      "end": 543.47,
      "en": "And now the last phrase that we're going to look at today was made famous by the cartoons, The Simpsons.",
      "zh": "现在，我们今天要看的最后一句话因卡通片《辛普森一家》而闻名。"
