      "zh": "没有牛。"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 548.36,
      "end": 549.78,
      "en": "So, to not have a cow.",
      "zh": "所以，没有牛。"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 550.0,
      "end": 550.98,
      "en": "Don't have a cow means?",
      "zh": "没有牛是什么意思？"
