    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 551.96,
      "end": 555.38,
      "en": "To get really angry, to freak out, to get upset.",
      "zh": "真正生气，发疯，心烦意乱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 555.68,
      "end": 556.68,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 556.68,
      "end": 561.3,
      "en": "So, now we know that you say don't have a cow, but can I say it and use it in the positive?",
      "zh": "所以，现在我们知道你说没有奶牛，但我可以说出来并积极地使用它吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 561.52,
      "end": 564.98,
      "en": "Can I say, hey, my boss totally had a cow today in the office?",
      "zh": "我可以说，嘿，我的老板今天在办公室里完全有一头牛吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 565.42,
      "end": 565.6,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 565.76,
      "end": 569.66,
      "en": "And it means, again, so it freaked out, got angry, made a big deal of something.",
      "zh": "这意味着，再一次，它吓坏了，生气了，做了很多事情。"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 569.96,
      "end": 570.26,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 570.4,
      "end": 570.98,
      "en": "He had a cow.",
      "zh": "他有一头牛。"
