    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 577.84,
      "end": 579.03,
      "en": "How can you smash his car?",
      "zh": "你怎么能砸他的车？"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 579.69,
      "end": 579.91,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 580.36,
      "end": 588.59,
      "en": "But now it's time for us to listen to this dialogue for the last time and then we'll come back and talk a little bit more about this decade of the 1980s.",
      "zh": "但现在是我们最后一次听这个对话的时候了，然后我们会回来多谈谈 1980 年代的这个十年。"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 589.72,
      "end": 596.88,
      "en": "Jim, what's up, man?",
      "zh": "吉姆，怎么了，伙计？"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 596.88,
      "end": 601.8,
      "en": "Charlie, is that your ride?",
      "zh": "查理，那是你的车吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 601.8,
      "end": 603.08,
      "en": "It's butt ugly, dude.",
      "zh": "伙计，这车丑死了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 604.64,
      "end": 605.46,
      "en": "Don't be an airhead.",
      "zh": "别犯傻。"
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 606.04,
      "end": 608.18,
      "en": "This is a 1969 Chevy Impala.",
      "zh": "这是一辆 1969 年的雪佛兰黑斑羚。"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 608.84,
      "end": 610.12,
      "en": "I just need to fix it up a bit.",
      "zh": "我稍微整修一下就好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 610.52,
      "end": 612.46,
      "en": "In a couple of months, this baby is going to be wicked.",
      "zh": "过几个月，这宝贝肯定酷毙了。"
    },
