    },
    {
      "id": 270,
      "start": 624.24,
      "end": 625.24,
      "en": "Be cool.",
      "zh": "冷静点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 271,
      "start": 629.05,
      "end": 629.65,
      "en": "Hey, guys.",
      "zh": "嗨，各位。"
    },
    {
      "id": 272,
      "start": 630.05,
      "end": 631.15,
      "en": "What do you think of my automobile?",
      "zh": "你觉得我的车怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 631.79,
      "end": 632.81,
      "en": "Isn't it bad to the bone?",
      "zh": "这车是不是酷到骨子里？"
    },
    {
      "id": 274,
      "start": 632.97,
      "end": 633.19,
      "en": "Word.",
      "zh": "可不是嘛。"
    },
    {
      "id": 275,
      "start": 634.03,
      "end": 638.33,
      "en": "The ladies are going to be lining up to get with you when they see you driving around in that car.",
      "zh": "姑娘们看到你开着这车，肯定排着队想认识你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 276,
      "start": 638.83,
      "end": 639.59,
      "en": "You really think so?",
      "zh": "你真这么觉得？"
    },
    {
      "id": 277,
      "start": 639.87,
      "end": 640.21,
      "en": "For sure.",
      "zh": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "id": 278,
      "start": 640.97,
      "end": 641.09,
      "en": "Awesome.",
      "zh": "太棒了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 279,
      "start": 641.92,
      "end": 642.92,
      "en": "Psyche.",
      "zh": "逗你的！"
    },
    {
      "id": 280,
      "start": 643.25,
      "end": 644.39,
      "en": "You totally fell for it.",
      "zh": "你还真信了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 281,
      "start": 645.04,
      "end": 646.09,
      "en": "You're a real scumbag, Charlie.",
      "zh": "查理，你真够混蛋的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 282,
      "start": 646.68,
      "end": 649.59,
      "en": "When I do the nasty with the prom queen, we'll see who has the last laugh.",
      "zh": "当我对舞会女王做恶心时，我们会看看谁笑到了最后。"
    },
    {
      "id": 283,
      "start": 650.11,
      "end": 651.09,
      "en": "Dude, don't have a cow.",
      "zh": "哥们儿，别激动。"
    },
    {
      "id": 284,
      "start": 656.32,
      "end": 656.76,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 285,
      "start": 656.76,
      "end": 660.5,
      "en": "So, Marco, when I was listening to the dialogue this time, I heard a really cool word.",
      "zh": "所以，Marco，当我这次听对话时，我听到了一个非常酷的词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 286,
      "start": 660.92,
      "end": 663.12,
      "en": "They said, psyche.",
      "zh": "他们说，心灵。"
    },
    {
      "id": 287,
      "start": 663.12,
      "end": 664.12,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 288,
      "start": 664.12,
      "end": 669.6,
      "en": "And this was a very popular thing during the 80s when you would say to somebody, Psych.",
      "zh": "在 80 年代，当你会对某人说，Psych 时，这是一件非常流行的事情。"
    },
    {
      "id": 289,
      "start": 669.6,
      "end": 672.2,
      "en": "So this is like saying just kidding, right?",
      "zh": "所以这就像说开玩笑吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 290,
      "start": 672.28,
      "end": 673.28,
      "en": "Just kidding, right.",
      "zh": "开个玩笑吧"
    },
    {
      "id": 291,
      "start": 673.28,
      "end": 675.36,
      "en": "So you would say, oh, Erica, I really like your hat.",
      "zh": "所以你会说，哦，艾丽卡，我真的很喜欢你的帽子。"
    },
    {
      "id": 292,
      "start": 675.68,
      "end": 676.26,
      "en": "Oh, thank you.",
      "zh": "哦，谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "id": 293,
      "start": 676.6,
      "end": 677.82,
      "en": "Psych, that hat is terrible.",
      "zh": "心理，那顶帽子太可怕了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 294,
      "start": 678.44,
      "end": 678.58,
      "en": "Oh.",
      "zh": "哦。"
    },
    {
      "id": 295,
      "start": 679.38,
      "end": 679.82,
      "en": "Right?",
      "zh": "对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 296,
      "start": 680.32,
      "end": 681.32,
      "en": "So that's how you would use it.",
      "zh": "所以这就是你使用它的方式。"
    },
    {
      "id": 297,
      "start": 681.32,
      "end": 690.64,
      "en": "You would give somebody a compliment or you would lie to somebody and then tell them, Psych, and then like tell them the truth like, oh, that hat is terrible or I was just kidding.",
      "zh": "你会称赞某人，或者你会对某人撒谎，然后告诉他们，心理，然后像告诉他们真相一样，哦，那顶帽子很糟糕，或者我只是在开玩笑。"
    },
    {
      "id": 298,
      "start": 691.64,
      "end": 692.64,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 299,
      "start": 692.64,
      "end": 693.64,
      "en": "So, psyche.",
      "zh": "所以，心灵。"
    },
    {
      "id": 300,
      "start": 693.64,
      "end": 694.64,
      "en": "That was a phrase.",
      "zh": "那是一个短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 301,
      "start": 694.64,
      "end": 698.24,
      "en": "It was very, very popular and when I was in school, we would use it as well.",
      "zh": "它非常非常受欢迎，当我在学校时，我们也会使用它。"
    },
    {
      "id": 302,
      "start": 698.24,
      "end": 699.74,
      "en": "We would psych each other out.",
      "zh": "我们会互相心理。"
    },
    {
      "id": 303,
      "start": 700.04,
      "end": 701.38,
      "en": "So do we still use this phrase today?",
      "zh": "那么我们今天还使用这个短语吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 304,
      "start": 701.99,
      "end": 703.21,
      "en": "I don't think we use it today.",
      "zh": "我不认为我们今天使用它。"
    },
    {
      "id": 305,
      "start": 703.36,
      "end": 704.44,
      "en": "I don't think it's cool anymore.",
      "zh": "我不认为它再酷了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 306,
      "start": 704.51,
      "end": 706.69,
      "en": "Well, if you'd use it, it's kind of like you're joking, right?",
      "zh": "好吧，如果你使用它，这有点像你在开玩笑，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 307,
      "start": 706.95,
      "end": 707.17,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 308,
      "start": 707.25,
      "end": 708.81,
      "en": "And I think it would make people laugh.",
      "zh": "我认为这会让人们发笑。"
    },
    {
      "id": 309,
      "start": 709.08,
      "end": 710.48,
      "en": "Like, you know, it's pretty funny.",
      "zh": "就像，你知道，这很有趣。"
    },
    {
      "id": 310,
      "start": 710.48,
      "end": 711.48,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 311,
      "start": 711.48,
      "end": 713.0,
      "en": "You're joking about how you're a little bit old-fashioned.",
      "zh": "你在开玩笑说你有点老式。"
    },
    {
      "id": 312,
      "start": 713.0,
      "end": 714.0,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 313,
      "start": 714.0,
      "end": 715.0,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 314,
      "start": 715.25,
      "end": 720.07,
      "en": "I'm very sure you would surprise a lot of your native English-speaking friends if you use this phrase.",
      "zh": "我很确定，如果你使用这句话，你会惊讶于你的许多母语英语朋友。"
    },
    {
      "id": 315,
      "start": 720.52,
      "end": 721.52,
      "en": "A good one to try out.",
      "zh": "一个很好的尝试。"
    },
    {
      "id": 316,
      "start": 721.52,
      "end": 727.88,
      "en": "Now, if you have any questions about this phrase or any other of the language, come to our website at EnglishPod.com.",
      "zh": "现在，如果您对这个短语或任何其他语言有任何疑问，请访问我们的网站 englishpod.com。"
    },
    {
      "id": 317,
      "start": 728.49,
      "end": 728.67,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 318,
      "start": 728.73,
      "end": 734.56,
      "en": "We're there to answer all your questions and also let us know any other lessons or topics that you would like to learn about in the future.",
      "zh": "我们在那里回答您的所有问题，并让我们知道您将来想了解的任何其他课程或主题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 319,
      "start": 735.0,
      "end": 736.94,
      "en": "Well, thanks for listening to this lesson, you guys.",
      "zh": "好吧，谢谢你听了这节课，你们。"
    },
    {
      "id": 320,
      "start": 737.52,
      "end": 738.52,
      "en": "And until next time, goodbye.",
      "zh": "下次再见，拜拜。"
    },
